<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Diabetic Retinopathy Detection - Welcome</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background-image: url('bg1.jpeg');
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        .container {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            
            padding: 3em;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 10px;
            animation: flyBeat 3s ease infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes flyBeat {
            0% { transform: translateY(0); }
            100% { transform: translateY(-20px); }
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 1em;
            color: #333;
        }

        .description {
            margin: 1em 0;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #666;
        }

        .points {
            text-align: left;
            margin: 1em 0;
            color: #444;
        }

        .points li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
        }

        .buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1em;
            margin-top: 2em;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .button {
            padding: 0.7em 2em;
            background: #007BFF;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 200px; /* Limit button width */
            text-align: center; /* Center button text */
            animation: beat 2s ease infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes beat {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            100% { transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        .button:hover {
            background: #0056b3;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 2em;
            color: #aaa;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome to Diabetic Retinopathy Detection</h1>
        <div class="description">
            Our advanced Model helps in early detection and monitoring of Diabetic Retinopathy. Join us in the fight against vision loss.
        </div>
        <div class="points">
            <ul>
                <li>Early detection can prevent vision loss.</li>
                <li>Regular screening is crucial for diabetic patients.</li>
                <li>Our machine learning model provides accurate and fast results.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="buttons">
            <a href="/signup" class="button">Register</a>
            <a href="/login" class="button">Login</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2025 Diabetic Retinopathy Detection. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
